# Xilinx 7-series mapping of alu_top (Yosys built-in synth_xilinx flow).
# Run after scripts/read_rtl.ys and `chparam -set USE_RCA <0|1> alu_top`.
# Output: mapped primitives (LUTn, CARRY4, MUXF7, FD*). Not a Vivado result.

hierarchy -check -top alu_top
synth_xilinx -top alu_top -flatten
check -assert
log === STAT_FINAL ===
stat

# No `ltp` here: `ltp -noff` only recognizes Yosys-internal FF cells, so it
# treats mapped flip-flops (SB_DFF*, FDRE) as combinational logic -- on the
# Xilinx netlist it even reports false loops. Logic depth is reported for the
# generic flow only; real timing would need place-and-route (not installed).
